/// Wide-form dispatcher invoked by `op_wide` / `op_extra_wide`.
/// Reads the semantic byte at `bytes[pc+1]`, decodes wide-form operands,
/// calls the matching semantic body, and returns a `SemanticOutcome`
/// with `pc_advance` = full wide-form instruction length.
///
/// Auto-generated from `tools/lyng-dsl-codegen/src/main.rs`'s
/// `COLD_STUBS` + `HOT_WARM_STUBS` tables.
